{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"Sortie des ombres","Juif originaire de Pologne, Chaïm Rozent est assassiné par les nazis le 6 avril 1944 dans un village de Corrèze. Disparu de la mémoire collective, la figure de Chaïm se dévoile progressivement au cours du film grâce à l’enquête sensible et documentée menée par le réalisateur : de la foisonnante culture yiddish en Pologne où Chaïm était violoniste à l’exil dans la France occupée, jusqu’en Israël où vivent aujourd’hui ses descendants. Une lente sortie des ombres.",[4,5,6],"personal memory","collective trauma","rural",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":13,"filmType":17,"directors":18,"genre":27,"media":29,"synopsis":31,"production":32,"characters":38,"roles":39,"awards":44,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_240","fr2023-240-sortie-des-ombres",{"native":1,"english":12},"",{"type":14,"date":15,"year":16},"Theatrical release","2023-01-01",2023,"Documentary",[19],{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":26},"Patrick Séraudie","patrick-seraudie",1960,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[28],"Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":12},"https://citoyliens.fr/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/sortie-des-ombres-1.jpg",{"native":2,"english":12},[33,35],{"country":25,"share":34},"Majority coproducer",{"country":36,"share":37},"Poland","Minority coproducer",[],[40],{"person":41,"role":43},{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":42},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
